### 创建自定义 Agent
# 允许绑定模型、MCP、技能(Skills)以及知识库(KnowledgeBases)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/agents
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization: Bearer your-token

{
  "name": "Data Analyst Agent",
  "description": "专业的本地数据分析智能体",
  "systemPrompt": "你是一个资深的数据分析师，擅长处理结构化数据并给出洞察。",
  "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
  "temperature": 0.3,
  "skills": ["read_file", "write_file", "run_cmd"],
  "mcpServers": ["sqlite_mcp"],
  "knowledgeBases": ["data_analysis_docs"]
}

### 获取所有 Agent 列表
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/agents
# Authorization: Bearer your-token

### 获取单个 Agent 详情
# 替换 {{agentId}} 为上一步创建后返回的 id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/agents/{{agentId}}
# Authorization: Bearer your-token

### 更新自定义 Agent
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/agents/{{agentId}}
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization: Bearer your-token

{
  "name": "Senior Data Analyst Agent",
  "temperature": 0.5,
  "skills": ["read_file", "write_file", "run_cmd", "python_repl"]
}

### 删除自定义 Agent
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/agents/{{agentId}}
# Authorization: Bearer your-token

### 使用指定的 Agent 进行聊天对话
# 在 payload 中提供 agentId，会话将自动应用该 Agent 的配置（如系统提示词、模型、技能限制和知识库）
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization: Bearer your-token

{
  "message": "请帮我分析一下最近的销售数据",
  "agentId": "{{agentId}}"
}
